      "target": "U2, U5, and every write-bearing Unit \u2014 The error taxonomy and the server-supplied `retryable` envelope field are U2 \u2014 `retryable` is not a per-feature choice. The queued three-state case is U5. Preserving typed input on a failed write is a standing obligation on every Unit that writes."
