      "target": "U3, then every screen-bearing Unit \u2014 Server-side collation and Latin-numeral rendering are established in U3. Both bundles present, no hardcoded strings, and the longest-Bangla-string layout check are standing per-Unit obligations."
    },
    {
      "id": "US9.4",
      "status": "OK",
      "target": "U11, and every screen-bearing Unit \u2014 AC9.4.3's deletion-confirmation copy is U11, because it must agree with the disposition manifest. No colour-only status and correct back-stack behaviour are per-Unit obligations \u2014 AC9.4.2 is a privacy case, not a navigation nicety."
    },
    {
      "id": "US10.1",
